{"id":"a09c1d00e35d","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers/career-counselling","lang":"en","title":"Career counselling","description":"For USI students and newly graduates the Career Service is available for private career advisory meetings on how to: conduct an employment search write a curriculum vitae (CV) write a motivation letter prepare for a job interview To book an appointment: contact the service…","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Alumni","Careers"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/alumni-orientamento-professionale.jpg?itok=cC8a93Wp","words":191,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/alumni/carriera/orientamento-professionale","en":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers/career-counselling"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"Careers","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers"},{"label":"Career counselling","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/alumni-orientamento-professionale.jpg?itok=cC8a93Wp","alt":"alumni-usi-orientamento-professionale","caption":""}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p>For USI students and newly graduates the <a href=\"/en/originalnode/655\">Career Service</a> is available for private career advisory meetings on how to:</p> <ul> <li>conduct an employment search</li> <li>write a curriculum vitae (CV)</li> <li>write a motivation letter</li> <li>prepare for a job interview</li> </ul> <p> To book an appointment: contact the <a href=\"https://cvbook.lu.usi.ch/(S(ebqd4k1uk4cuxrw2cbc5bboa))/Home.aspx\">service</a> attaching your CV (if you do not have one, fill in the <a href=\"https://cvbook.lu.usi.ch/(S(bm2u3y4soet2vpskmoxka035))/Home.aspx\">USI CV form</a>)</p> <p>Furthermore USI graduates may register for <a href=\"/en/career-management-workshops-prepare-and-manage-your-career\">Career Management Workshops</a>: professional orientation workshops, held by the Career Service along with Human Resources professionals.</p> <p><em>Note: </em>The aim of the Career Service is to provide support during the transition into the world of work. The internship/job search process, as well as the selection process, is under the responsibility of the individual student/newly graduate.</p> <p><a href=\"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-alumni-mentors\">USI Alumni Career Mentoring</a>:</p> <p>Do you want to become a Mentor and offer advice and information about the job market and share your own post-USI graduation career experiences in your field to help current USI students start their professional journey? Contact us: <a href=\"mailto:alumni@usi.ch\">alumni@usi.ch</a></p> <p><a href=\"/en/university/info/career/events/career-mentoring\">Here</a> more information about the USI Alumni in Finance Career Mentoring, dedicated to Master in Finance students matched with USI Alumni working in the finance field.</p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"My Alumni profile","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/profile"},{"label":"My career story","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/my-career-story"},{"label":"Benefits","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/benefits"},{"label":"My Chapter","href":"/en/originalnode/8951"},{"label":"Alumni calendar","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/events/alumni-calendar"},{"label":"Alumni Talks","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/digital-talks"},{"label":"Visiting Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/visiting-alumni"},{"label":"Chapter Meetings","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/chapter-meetings"},{"label":"Reunions","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/reunions"},{"label":"Key figures","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-graduates"},{"label":"USI Career Stories","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories"},{"label":"USI Alumni Mentors","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-alumni-mentors"},{"label":"Placement survey","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/survey"},{"label":"Chapters","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/chapters"},{"label":"Executive Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/executive-alumni"},{"label":"Master groups","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/master-groups"},{"label":"AMA","href":"/en/universita/info/alumni/network/ama"},{"label":"Career calendar","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/events/career-calendar"},{"label":"Job offers","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers/job-internship-offers"},{"label":"Career counselling","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers/career-counselling"},{"label":"Alumni News","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/news/alumni-news"},{"label":"USI Alumni Award","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/usi-alumni-award"},{"label":"USI Alumni Newsletter","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/news/newsletter"},{"label":"Alumni Service Team","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/alumni-service"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/alumni/careers/career-counselling","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:48:25.248Z"}